{"articleNo":"191013","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=191013&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2018년도 상반기 연구실 정기(온라인)교육 과정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.04.03","hit":"4099","attachments":[{"name":"안전관리시스템 사용자 메뉴얼.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=191013&attachNo=79159"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2018년 상반기 연구실 정기(온라인)교육과정 안내</span></strong><br><strong><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">연구실 안전환경 조성에 관한 법률 제18조<br>금오공과대학교 연구실 안전관리 규정 제11조에 의거</span></strong><br><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\"2018년도 상반기 연구활동종사자 안전(정기)교육\"</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">을 다음과 같이 실시함을 공지하오니, 반드시 기간내에 이수할 수 있도록 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #ff0000\">● </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #ffff00\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #000000\"><strong>교육기간 : 2018.04.02. ~ 05.31. </strong><p><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">●</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;교육방법 </span></font></font></p><p><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 온라인 : 연구실안전관리시스템</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">(</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr/\"></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)</span></span></font></font></p><p><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11px\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;모바일 : msafety.kumoh.ac.kr 수강</span></span></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">● <font color=\"#0900ff\">안전교육 대상자 </font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;연구활동종사자 : 연구실책임자(교수), 연구원, 대학원생, 학부생 등</span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#000000\"> - 반기별 6시간 이상&nbsp; : 화학, 기계계열 등의 고위험군</font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 반기별 3시간 이상&nbsp; : 컴퓨터, 전자계열 등의 저위험군</span></span></font></span></span></p><p><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 대상자는 연구실안전관리시스템(</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><u><font>http://labsafety.kumoh.ac.kr</font></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)에 로그인(원스톱아이디)&nbsp; 후&nbsp;</span></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>\"<font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e545d0\" color=\"#ffffff\">안전교육수강</font>\"</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">버튼을 클릭하면 대상자인지 확인할 </span></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><font color=\"#000000\">수 있음.</font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">◆ 신규대상자(2018년 신입학및 편입학생)는&nbsp;2018년 2학기부터 온라인교육 이수함</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">◆ 교육시간은 법정사항이며, 교육수강후 반드시 평가(60점이상)까지 완료해야 이수처리됨</span><br></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#000000\">◆<font color=\"#000000\"> </font></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#000000\">관련문의 : 시설안전과 054)478-7137&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">붙임 : 사용메뉴얼1부.</span></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - &nbsp;시&nbsp; 설&nbsp; 안&nbsp; 전&nbsp; 과&nbsp; -</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--#DOCUMENT--></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></font></p></span></span></div><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
